  "id": "linux-nvidia-dgx-spark-2x-glm53-atlas",
  "name": "2x DGX Spark GLM-5.3 Flash NVFP4 Atlas",
  "version": 1,
  "summary": "Candidate lane for two directly connected Sparks running Atlas SparkGLM over the private fabric, serving GLM-5.3-Flash-NVFP4 from a once-per-node overlay conversion with 524288-token contexts for four concurrent requests and DFlash2 speculative decoding. Additive only: no default model, no aliases overwritten.",
  "description": "This recipe installs the Atlas SparkGLM candidate at the immutable product revision recorded in backends/atlas-sparkglm/pins.json. LLooM owns orchestration, admission, worker-first startup, readiness, routing and telemetry. The Atlas engine image is built from Enntity/sparkglm by that repository's install/build.sh; LLooM commits no engine source. The engine (Atlas-Inf/atlas with SparkGLM's work on the Enntity/atlas fork) is AGPL-3.0-only and runs from its own container image, and the DFlash2 drafter weights are CC BY-NC-ND 4.0 (non-commercial). Setup acquires the pinned model, pulls the pinned image from GHCR or builds it from the pinned source with the same tag, performs the overlay conversion, and the serving path only ever starts the prepared image. Each node verifies the image by its io.enntity.sparkglm.install-tree label and arm64 architecture. The candidate includes structured output and tool calls plus image/video input; live hardware and full serving qualification remain pending.",
  "license": {
    "id": "MIT",
    "name": "Recipe metadata, launcher and orchestration"
  },
  "provenance": {
    "createdBy": "lloom",
    "generatedBy": "manual-curated",
    "source": "Atlas SparkGLM candidate at product revision e58cdc237522f70e82d95e835721660608860eac (engine Enntity/atlas sparkglm/atlas-20260930e @ 08c90d8e, AGPL-3.0-only, recorded in the image's /opt/atlas/source-manifest.json; corresponding source is Enntity/sparkglm at that revision plus that Enntity/atlas commit). Image ghcr.io/enntity/atlas-sparkglm:76b6e4976aa1 is pulled from GHCR or built from Enntity/sparkglm install/ at that revision with the same tag; each host verifies its io.enntity.sparkglm.install-tree label equals install tree 76b6e4976aa109efa2760b8168f81c4b90521d79 and the image is arm64. Model nvidia/GLM-5.3-Flash-NVFP4 revision 423acf37583782c51c142d145aef733d72943d93 requires a once-per-node overlay conversion gated on conversion.complete.json plus verification; the DFlash2 drafter incoai/GLM-5.3-Flash-DFlash2 revision 7d74cdd881ed7e32c31175984a67823127b66cfe (CC BY-NC-ND 4.0, non-commercial) is served from its checkpoint. The engine argument vector ships inside the image as /opt/atlas/profiles/4x512k.json (the entrypoint default), not in this recipe. The profile carries 524288-token contexts, four sequences sharing one physical KV pool (GLM latent in FP8 with per-128 scales, about 1.6M tokens at the recipe's 0.93 GPU memory utilization, which overrides the profile default of 0.88, and shared with the prefix cache), FP32 SSM state with KDA record rollback, and DFlash2 (gamma 8) on the head rank; disable-tool-grammar is deliberately not set so structured output and tools stay functional."
  },
